 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;2PL&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>    verbose </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>       AIC     </span><span style=\"color:#606\">AICc</span><span style=\"color:#000\">    SABIC       HQ      BIC    logLik      X2<br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10456.95</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10528.03</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10475.29</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10557.72</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10706.65</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5155.474</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     </span><span style=\"color:#008\">NaN</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10267.49</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10783.04</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10303.67</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10466.26</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10760.05</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">4989.744</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">331.461</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>   df   p</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">NaN</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">NaN</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#066\">71</span><span style=\"color:#000\">   </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><div><br><br></div><div>Based on above output, which model is better?<br></div>"
